{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてごめんなさい～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"m(｡･ε･｡)mｽｲﾏｿ-ﾝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑こんな顔してめちゃ反省してます↑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真は真夏の全国ツアーに向けてのリハが終わって汗かいてお風呂入る直前のまあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３人で久しぶりのオフだったので\n前日まあや家にお泊りして次の火遊びに行くという充実した楽しい休日過ごしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜全然眠れなかったよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもはまあやが一番に寝ちゃうんだけど今回はちーちゃんが一番に夢の中でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみちゃんは安定の一番最後"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんとあみちゃんはまあやのお姫様カーテン付のベットがお気に入りみたいで嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もんじゃ焼きやお肉にカレー夜はお菓子パーティーとたくさん食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊びに行こうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつでも泊まりにおいで～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人暮らしなので久しぶりに賑やかでたのちかったっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎえいごみたよーって方～ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやってのぎえいごの番組のレギュラーやらせてもらって最近前より日常会話に英語入れるようになった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから無意識に国語の小論文でアンダースタンド使っちゃって先生に赤ペンで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや！論文はなるべく日本語で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まえも755で同じような事書いたよね...もう次はないようにします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそしてね、ラーメンウォーカーの方にも出演させてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての経験！手打ちラーメン？やったよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"粘土してる気分だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラーメンも最高で幸せなひと時でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！！！そして広島ホームテレビの鯉のはなシアターにも出演させてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島出身として小さい頃から知ってる番組だったから不思議"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島ぶち大好きじゃけぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*ﾉωﾉ)ﾎﾟｯ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0025.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前まいやんと２人でひなちまの帝一みてきたーヾ(*´∀｀*)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうほんっと面白くて笑ってばっかでいい舞台だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまがいつも一緒にいるとき練習してたからこれがここかぁ！！！って思いながら見るのも楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてきぃちゃんとゆったんhappybirthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(〃･ω･)ﾉ☆ﾟ'･:*☆ｵﾒﾃﾞﾄ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんが19とか見えない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも年下に接してる感じするもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはちょっと頼ってみようかなぁ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃんはあーみえてちゃんと考えてるところ尊敬するぞっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに昨日きぃちゃんが自分の着てる誰でも書けるようなキリンの絵を見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"｢これまあやさん書きそう！｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くっちょぉっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今度まあやがデザインした素敵なTシャツプレゼントするね！っていった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてゆったん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんはいつも意味もないのに名前よんでくる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一期生として一緒にいろいろ乗り越えてきたこともあって一緒にいる時間すごく多くて...だからゆったんが口にしなくてもまあやはもうなんでもわかるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもピョンピョンしてオモチャみたいなゆったん大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人とも素敵な一年を過ごしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0033.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土日は京都にて全国握手会個別握手会、セブンイレブンライブだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会では浴衣着ようかな？どうおもう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/07/21/3959730/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}